NeoForge 26.1.2 Generator (plugin for MCreator 2026.3)

This plugin is a modified copy of the Minecraft 26.1.x Java Edition generators
(NeoForge 26.1.2, data pack and resource pack) that were part of MCreator
2026.3 up to the second snapshot. It is not an official MCreator product and
has no connection to Pylo.

